# Glasses gateway (gateway/server.mjs). Copy to `.env.local`. Never commit `.env.local`.
# The origin must also be in app.json's network whitelist.
# No shared key here anymore: each device pairs itself on first launch (see
# gateway/README.md) and stores its own token in the glasses' local storage.
VITE_NOD_GATEWAY=http://192.168.1.10:8787
